<section class="brand-hero brand-hero--wip">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brand-hero__layout">
      <div class="brand-hero__inner">
        <nav class="brand-hero__crumb"><a href="index.html">단무지공방</a><span>/</span><a href="index.html#brands">Brand</a><span>/</span><span style="color:#fff">WIP</span></nav>
        <h1 class="brand-hero__name">FORWARD WIP</h1>
        <p class="brand-hero__tagline">스위스 워터스포츠 안전장비<br>프로 세일·윙·카이트 검증</p>
        <p class="brand-hero__lead">스위스 본사가 프로 세일링·포일링 환경에서 개발한 안전장비 전문 brand. Raley Impact Vest · Prowip 2.0 헬멧 · Wing Belt 4.0 하네스 · UV Quickdry 라인 — 윙·포일·카이트·세일 종목 통합에 모두 사용. 보호력과 활동성을 동시에 만족.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="#lineup" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg">WIP 라인업</a><a href="index.html#contact" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--lg">단무지에 문의</a></div>
        <dl class="brand-hero__meta">
          <div><dt>원산</dt><dd>스위스 · Pro 검증</dd></div>
          <div><dt>전문</dt><dd>임팩트 · 헬멧 · 하네스 · UV</dd></div>
          <div><dt>호환</dt><dd>네 가지 브랜드 hardware 동반자</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="brand-hero__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="brand-hero__visual-ring"></div>
        <div class="brand-hero__visual-ring brand-hero__visual-ring--2"></div>
        <div class="brand-hero__visual-ring brand-hero__visual-ring--3"></div>
        <div class="brand-hero__visual-orbit-dot"></div>
        <div class="brand-hero__monogram-xl">W</div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 480 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:absolute;inset:0">
          <!-- Helmet silhouette -->
          <g transform="translate(240, 290)" opacity="0.7">
            <path d="M-60 0 Q-60 -60 0 -60 Q60 -60 60 0 L60 20 Q60 30 50 30 L-50 30 Q-60 30 -60 20 Z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.32)" stroke-width="2"/>
            <line x1="-30" y1="-30" x2="-50" y2="0" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.20)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="30" y1="-30" x2="50" y2="0" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.20)" stroke-width="1"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <!-- DO_NOT_REVERT §145-C (Danny 2026-05-12): "스위스 엔지니어링 보호장비" badge 영구 삭제. -->
